  "recognized_text": "Hello. How can I help you? Hi. My train to Riverside at 3:15 has been canceled. I'm sorry about that. The train has a technical problem. When do you need to get there? Before 6:00. I have a family dinner and I don't want to miss it. The next train is at 4:40 but it arrives at 10 past 6:00. That's too late for me. Is there any other way to get there before 6:00? There's a replacement bus at 3:45. It takes about 2 hours so it arrives at about 5:45. Your ticket is valid on it. Oh, that's good news. Is there anything faster? I'd like to arrive a bit earlier. There's also an express bus at 4:00 from the bus station across the street. It arrives at about 5:30 but it costs $8 more. Then I'll save the money and take the replacement bus. Where does it leave from? From the bus stop on the left as you leave the station. Look for the yellow sign. Great. So the bus at 3:45 from the stop on the left and I don't need a new ticket. That's right. I hope you get there in time.",
  "source_text": "Hello. How can I help you? Hi. My train to Riverside at three fifteen has been canceled. I'm sorry about that. The train has a technical problem. When do you need to get there? Before six. I have a family dinner, and I don't want to miss it. The next train is at four forty, but it arrives at ten past six. That's too late for me. Is there any other way to get there before six? There's a replacement bus at three forty-five. It takes about two hours, so it arrives at about five forty-five. Your ticket is valid on it. Oh, that's good news. Is there anything faster? I'd like to arrive a bit earlier. There's also an express bus at four, from the bus station across the street. It arrives at about five thirty, but it costs eight dollars more. Then I'll save the money and take the replacement bus. Where does it leave from? From the bus stop on the left as you leave the station. Look for the yellow sign. Great. So, the bus at three forty-five, from the stop on the left, and I don't need a new ticket. That's right. I hope you get there in time.",
  "source_turns": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hello. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Hi. My train to Riverside at three fifteen has been canceled."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I'm sorry about that. The train has a technical problem. When do you need to get there?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Before six. I have a family dinner, and I don't want to miss it."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "The next train is at four forty, but it arrives at ten past six."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "That's too late for me. Is there any other way to get there before six?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "There's a replacement bus at three forty-five. It takes about two hours, so it arrives at about five forty-five. Your ticket is valid on it."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Oh, that's good news. Is there anything faster? I'd like to arrive a bit earlier."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "There's also an express bus at four, from the bus station across the street. It arrives at about five thirty, but it costs eight dollars more."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Then I'll save the money and take the replacement bus. Where does it leave from?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "From the bus stop on the left as you leave the station. Look for the yellow sign."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Great. So, the bus at three forty-five, from the stop on the left, and I don't need a new ticket."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "That's right. I hope you get there in time."
    }
  ],
